flowchart LR
  DEV[Private Development] --> A[Private Alpha]
  A --> B[Private Beta]
  B --> RC[Release Candidate]
  RC --> PUB[Public v1.0]

  DEV --- D1[Private repo, issues, docs, no public package]
  A --- D2[Safe deterministic pack, redaction, basic Git]
  B --- D3[Intelligence, snapshots, profiles, providers, diagnostics]
  RC --- D4[Scope freeze, security/license/history/dependency/docs audit, signed artifacts]
  PUB --- D5[Public repository, npm package, docs, contribution and security policy]

  A -->|Gate failure| DEV
  B -->|Gate failure| A
  RC -->|Gate failure| B
